# Markdown here is not hard-wrapped — a paragraph is one line, and the editor
# or the browser wraps it. Without this, `prettier --write` re-flows every
# paragraph at 80 columns, which makes a one-word edit rewrite the paragraph
# and every diff unreadable.
#
# One thing prettier gets wrong even so: a GitHub alert needs its `[!NOTE]`
# marker on a line of its own, and joining the blockquote into one line breaks
# the callout. Those three blocks carry `<!-- prettier-ignore -->`.
proseWrap: never
